### Verificacion de Salud e Integracion Local (LAB-110)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@ingestUrl = http://localhost:8000
@litellmUrl = http://localhost:4000
@frontendUrl = http://localhost:4200

### 1. Backend Spring Boot Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Ingest FastAPI Health
GET {{ingestUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 3. LiteLLM Model Gateway Liveliness
GET {{litellmUrl}}/health/liveliness
Accept: application/json

### 4. Frontend SPA NGINX Index
GET {{frontendUrl}}/
Accept: text/html
